          "key": "readme",
          "title": "Improve the README",
          "instruction": "On **Code**, select **Add file**, update **README.md** with what the project does, getting started guidance, contribution guidance, and license information, then select **Commit changes**.",
          "hint": "A useful README answers what the project is, why it matters, how to start, and where contributors should look next.",
          "explanation": "README is often the first file visitors see, so it should orient users and contributors before they open issues or pull requests.",
          "targetId": "add-file",
